{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"title":"onAdd(_:perform:)","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onAdd"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"perform"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"World","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Void","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Hooks.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Hooks.swift#L92"},"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","extendedModule":"WorldModule","externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A0V5onAdd_7performyxm_yACz_AA6EntityVtYbctAA9ComponentRzlF"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Registers a closure to run whenever an entity gains a component of the given type."}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onAdd(_:perform:)-27g0l"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onInsert(_:perform:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onRemove(_:perform:)-2t2p","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onAdd(_:perform:)-8d74u","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onRemove(_:perform:)-5cn3d","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/removeHooks(of:)"],"anchor":"Responding-to-Component-Changes-with-Hooks","generated":true,"title":"Responding to Component Changes with Hooks"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onAdd"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"type"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"perform"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"hook"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@escaping "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@Sendable"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World","text":"World"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Entity","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","text":"Component"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component type to watch."}]}],"name":"type"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The closure to run, given the world and the entity that gained a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"hook"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use hooks to keep data outside the components in step with them, such as an index of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entities by name. An "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"add hook","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" runs when an entity that didn’t hold a "},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" gets one, by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spawning, inserting or applying a command. Replacing a "},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" the entity already holds"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t run it; see "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/onInsert(_:perform:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for a hook that runs then too."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example records each named entity in a resource as it’s spawned:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct NameDirectory: Resource { var entities: [String: Entity] = [:] }","","var world = World()","world.resources.insert(NameDirectory())","world.onAdd(Name.self) { world, entity in","    let name = world[Name.self, of: entity].value","    world.resources[NameDirectory.self].entities[name] = entity","}","","let hero = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Hero\"))","print(world.resources[NameDirectory.self].entities[\"Hero\"] == hero)","\/\/ Prints \"true\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A hook runs after the world operation that fired it has finished, so it sees every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component a spawn or bundle insert gave. Hooks run in the order they were fired. A change"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that a hook makes fires hooks of its own, which run after the hooks already waiting."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Changes made in place, through the world’s subscript or an update, run no hooks."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Find those with change detection instead."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"style":"note","name":"Complexity","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(1) amortized.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/onadd(_:perform:)-27g0l"]}],"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/onRemove(_:perform:)-5cn3d":{"abstract":[{"text":"Registers a closure to run whenever an entity stops matching a query.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"onRemove(_:perform:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/onremove(_:perform:)-5cn3d","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onRemove"},{"kind":"text","text":"<each "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule5QueryV","text":"Query"},{"kind":"text","text":"<repeat each "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"perform"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule0A0V","text":"World"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void"},{"kind"